---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import HomeHero from "../components/HomeHero.astro";
---

<BaseLayout active="home" title="Jlemonz">
  <HomeHero />
  <section class="module-grid" aria-label="首页模块">
    <article class="diary-card diary-card--ticket panel"><h2>FILE 01 / SYNC</h2><p>把踩坑、命令和解决办法写清楚，下一次少绕一点路。</p></article>
    <article class="diary-card diary-card--ticket panel"><h2>FILE 02 / TRACE</h2><p>系统、驱动和服务的线索先留住，问题没解完也有现场可回看。</p></article>
    <article class="diary-card diary-card--ticket panel"><h2>FILE 03 / DAILY</h2><p>项目之外也有日常，轻一点的碎片也算进度。</p></article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
